<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Drop Participation Update</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f5;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181b;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f4f5;padding:24px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;">
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#0a0a0a;padding:20px 28px;">
              <span style="color:#D4AF37;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Engel Fine Design</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:28px;">
              {{#if recipientName}}<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;">Hi {{recipientName}},</p>{{/if}}
              <h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:#18181b;">Drop selection results</h1>
              <p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;">Thank you for your participation in the <strong>&ldquo;{{theme}}&rdquo;</strong> product drop. We wanted to let you know about the selection results.</p>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#fafafa;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:8px;margin:0 0 24px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:18px 20px;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717a;">Drop information</p>
                    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;"><strong>Theme:</strong> {{theme}}</p>
                    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;"><strong>Total submissions:</strong> {{totalSubmissions}}</p>
                    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;"><strong>Selected pieces:</strong> {{totalSelected}}</p>
                    <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;"><strong>Release date:</strong> {{releaseDate}}</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;">While your design didn't make the final selection this time, we want to thank you for your creativity and effort. We received many incredible submissions, and the selection process was highly competitive.</p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717a;">Don't be discouraged</p>
              <ul style="margin:0 0 24px;padding-left:20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#3f3f46;">
                <li>Future drops will have different themes and aesthetics</li>
                <li>Your work may be perfect for an upcoming drop</li>
                <li>Each submission helps us understand your style better</li>
                <li>We'd love to see you participate in future opportunities</li>
              </ul>

              <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;">Keep creating amazing work! Your unique perspective is valuable to our community.</p>

              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-radius:8px;background:#0a0a0a;">
                    <a href="{{actionUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">{{#if actionLabel}}{{actionLabel}}{{else}}View Other Opportunities{{/if}}</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:20px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e7;background:#fafafa;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#a1a1aa;">Engel Fine Design &middot; <a href="{{shopUrl}}" style="color:#a1a1aa;">Shop</a> &middot; Questions? <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color:#a1a1aa;">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
